<title>FRANCE: Total unit buys Brazilian resins firm.</title>
<headline>Total unit buys Brazilian resins firm.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>French energy group Total SA said on Wednesday that its resins subsidiary Cray Valley had acquired Ramires &amp; Cia Ltda (RCL) in Brazil for an undisclosed amount.</p>
<p>RCL is Brazil's second-largest producer of unsaturated polyester resins and polyester sealants with annual sales of $15 million.</p>
</text>
